      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this is modeled after the way codecs work, this change should not actually affect users of Skia until their builds include these defines.\n\nHave tested adding these defines to Chromium with this change, which fixes the issue where COLRv1 doesn\u0027t print correctly on Mac and Windows because Chromium was using a FreeType backed typeface for layout but the typeface was deserialized into a system backed typeface which didn\u0027t support COLRv1.",
      "revId": "70ab605173e4eb94f8e1b93b176dd6688a18abeb",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
