      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-17T16:39:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "FreeType needs to come last here so that `SkTypeface::MakeFromStream` will try one of the other system factories first. This is awkward, but if the user wanted to get something specific, they will need to make a more direct call (currently though some `SkFontMgr`).",
      "revId": "70ab605173e4eb94f8e1b93b176dd6688a18abeb",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
